          "id": "crash-after-splash",
          "title": "Crash right after the splash screen",
          "when": {},
          "variants": [
            {
              "id": "no-multisampling",
              "status": "unverified",
              "kind": "fix",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "ini_set": {
                    "root": "user_data",
                    "file": "TdGame\\Config\\TdEngine.ini",
                    "values": [
                      {
                        "section": "SystemSettings",
                        "key": "MaxMultisamples",
                        "value": "1"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "tradeoffs": [
                "Turns off multisample anti-aliasing"
              ],
              "sources": [
                {
                  "type": "pcgw",
                  "url": "https://www.pcgamingwiki.com/wiki/Mirror's_Edge#Crash_just_after_splash_screen"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tips": {
        "launch_options": [
          "-nostartupmovies"
        ],
        "notes": [
          {
            "text": "On AMD GPUs the NVIDIA GPU PhysX effects can be run through ZLUDA (32-bit PhysX): set the Steam launch option to \"<ZLUDA folder>\\32\\zluda.exe\" -- %command%. The ZLUDA docs list Mirror's Edge as tested. Install the current PhysX System Software (link below) first. Rerun does not ship ZLUDA; Windows Smart App Control may block it.",
