          },
          {
            "text": "NVIDIA's official PhysX System Software page (download).",
            "source": {
              "type": "official",
              "url": "https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/drivers/physx/physx-9-19-0218-driver/"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "If the game does not start and Mandatory ASLR was turned on system-wide, a Steam thread reports that disabling it for MirrorsEdge.exe in Windows Security (Exploit protection) helped (system setting, not a Rerun step).",
            "source": {
              "type": "steam-thread",
              "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/app/17410/discussions/0/3833171151458736010/"
            }
